  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To provide the Lebanese Ministry of Education with Technical Assistance on critical areas such as planning, financial management and data management to ensure the RACE II plan is delivered effectively and in a sustainable way.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity To provide the Lebanese Ministry of Education with Technical Assistance on critical areas such as planning, financial management and data management to ensure the RACE II plan is delivered effectively and in a sustainable way. is a component of Support to Lebanon&#x2019;s Reaching All Children with Education plan (RACE II) reported by FCDO with a funding type of 104 - Procurement of Services and a budget of &#xa3;5,640,872. It works in the following sector(s): Education policy and administrative management.</narrative>
  </description>
